<title>MEXICO: Ferrioni pays 0.75 peso per share dividend.</title>
<headline>Ferrioni pays 0.75 peso per share dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican clothing manufacturer Ferrioni S.A. de C.V. will pay a dividend of 0.75 pesos per outstanding share, the company said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In a statement to the Mexican Stock Exchange, Ferrioni said an annual shareholders' assembly had voted to pay the dividend.</p>
<p>Ferrioni added the dividend would be drawn from net fiscal earnings and would not therefore be taxable.</p>
<p>-- Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9562</p>
</text>
